What government position was held by the woman who portrayed Corliss Archer in the film Kiss and Tell?
The section mentions that Janet Waldo, an American radio and voice actress, is best known in animation for voicing Judy Jetson, Nancy in "Shazzan", Penelope Pitstop, and Josie in "Josie and the Pussycats", and on radio as the title character in "Meet Corliss Archer". The section also mentions that Meet Corliss Archer is a program from radio's Golden Age, which ran from January 7, 1943 to September 30, 1956. However, there is no mention of a government position being held by Janet Waldo. The section does mention that the office of Secretary of State for Constitutional Affairs was a British Government position, created in 2003, but this is not relevant to the question at hand.
